But since we have the chance, I want everyone to see more of our magic.

99
00:15:56,411 --> 00:15:57,711
お、なんですかね？
Oh, what could it be?

100
00:15:57,771 --> 00:16:00,391
まずは手始めにね、ねねが初め。
First, to start off, Nene goes first.

101
00:16:01,131 --> 00:16:05,931
