I want to change this space just a little bit.
Everyone watch closely to see what changes.

102
00:16:06,631 --> 00:16:09,191
そんなのあるの？わかんないお前ら？
Is there something like that? You guys don't know?

103
00:16:09,411 --> 00:16:13,171
んーー、えい！
Hmm... Ei!

104
00:16:13,291 --> 00:16:18,611
え、でっか！大きいのきちゃった！
Eh, huge! Something huge came!

105
00:16:18,931 --> 00:16:19,531
びっくりした！
I was surprised!

106
00:16:19,531 --> 00:16:21,151
窓が大きくなった！
The window got bigger!

107
00:16:21,531 --> 00:16:22,491
大迫力！
Such high impact!

108
00:16:22,991 --> 00:16:25,871
じゃ、この窓をちょっと使ってさ、ちょっと私たちの召喚魔法を見せようじゃないですか。
Now, using this window a bit, why don't we show our summoning magic?

109
00:16:28,231 --> 00:16:29,411
獅白そんなものが使えるのか？
Shishiro, can you use something like that?

110
00:16:30,191 --> 00:16:32,031
いや、これはねみんなのパワーがいります。
No, this requires everyone's power.

111
00:16:32,251 --> 00:16:33,291
がんばろう！
Let's do our best!

112
00:16:33,431 --> 00:16:35,911
じゃあちょっと行きましょうみんな。せーの！
Then let's go, everyone. Ready, set!

113
00:16:38,351 --> 00:16:44,271
うーー、えい！
Uーー, ei!

114
00:16:46,531 --> 00:16:52,491
おおー！かっこいい！すげー！
Oooh! Cool! Awesome!

115
00:16:52,491 --> 00:16:54,751
なんか降りてくる！うわ！
Something's coming down! Whoa!

116
00:16:55,371 --> 00:16:58,611
すげー！降りてきてるー！
Awesome! It's coming down!

117
00:17:00,071 --> 00:17:04,171
ありがとう！にんじん！雪民！ししろんあいこ！召喚できました！
Thank you! Carrot! Yukimin! Shishiron Aiko!
Summoned successfully!

118
00:17:04,771 --> 00:17:07,631
召喚成功だ！やったね！
Summoning successful! Yay!

119
00:17:08,131 --> 00:17:13,311
じゃあ一緒にね、これでみんなも集合したことだしね、みんなも連れててくれるか？
So together, since everyone's gathered here now,
will you take them along too?

120
00:17:13,551 --> 00:17:15,891
ありがとうね！
Thank you!

121
00:17:16,551 --> 00:17:17,691
よーし！
Alright!

122
00:17:17,691 --> 00:17:19,551
じゃあそろそろ次の曲いっちゃおっかな！
Now, shall we move on to the next song?!

123
00:17:20,031 --> 00:17:22,851
でもさっきので結構MP使ったけど大丈夫そう？マジックポイント。
But we used quite a bit of MP just now, are we okay? Magic points.

124
00:17:24,031 --> 00:17:25,471
まだまだいけますよ！
We can still keep going!

125
00:17:25,631 --> 00:17:26,851
いけるよ！
We can!

126
00:17:27,211 --> 00:17:29,871
オッケー、じゃあこの後も楽しんでいってください！
Okay, then please enjoy the rest of the show too!

127
00:17:30,171 --> 00:17:33,671
それでは次の曲、いっちょの召喚！
Now, for the next song, a joint summoning!

128
00:17:33,271 --> 00:17:36,211
レッツゴー！楽しんでね！
Let's go! Enjoy yourselves!

129
00:18:06,871 --> 00:18:13,871
悪戯に君をずっと見ていた訳じゃない
It's not like I've been watching you playfully all along.

130
00:18:13,871 --> 00:18:19,771
僕の考えを当ててご覧よ
Try guessing what I'm thinking.

131
00:18:19,771 --> 00:18:22,071
些細な仕草 視線 瞬き
Trifling gestures, glances, blinks—

132
00:18:22,071 --> 00:18:24,571
君はもう掌に
you're already in the palm of my hand.

133
00:18:24,571 --> 00:18:28,971
剥き出しのtrapなんてかかる訳ないわ
There's no way I'd fall for such an obvious trap.

134
00:18:28,971 --> 00:18:33,871
甘い言葉にも惑わされない
I won't be swayed by sweet words either.

135
00:18:33,871 --> 00:18:36,971
心の奥の奥の奥まで見透かしちゃうよ
I'll see straight through to the very depths of your heart.

136
00:18:36,971 --> 00:18:37,671
(looking thinking touching feeling,)

137
00:18:37,671 --> 00:18:39,171
why you know?

138
00:18:39,171 --> 00:18:40,171
(looking thinking touching feeling,)

139
00:18:40,171 --> 00:18:41,471
i know it

140
00:18:41,471 --> 00:18:42,571
(looking thinking touching feeling,)

141
00:18:42,571 --> 00:18:43,771
understand?

142
00:18:43,771 --> 00:18:50,071
(meaning, meaning of love)

143
00:18:50,071 --> 00:18:51,171
“are you ready?”

144
